WEBVTT

00:08.875 --> 00:16.916
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.916 --> 00:24.914
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.432 --> 00:36.236
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.236 --> 00:39.239
Believing, dreaming

00:39.239 --> 00:43.076
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.076 --> 00:48.207
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:50.016 --> 00:58.425
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.425 --> 01:02.996
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.996 --> 01:05.665
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.665 --> 01:13.940
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.940 --> 01:18.900
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.447 --> 01:27.080
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:44.571 --> 01:46.596
How is it coming, Verdandi?

01:47.040 --> 01:49.099
I've just finished.

01:49.609 --> 01:52.812
What is all this? I don't get it at all.

01:52.812 --> 01:56.145
This equation is what will allow us
to obliterate Lord Loki.

01:56.583 --> 01:58.608
There are no errors in your
calculations, are there?

01:59.319 --> 02:02.777
As a diabolist, my calculations are infallible.

02:03.957 --> 02:09.623
The 16th Night
Bell of Evil

02:10.597 --> 02:14.467
Home we go, quick as can be, then
it's dinner, dinner, dinner!

02:14.467 --> 02:16.662
You're such a glutton, Fenrir.

02:16.970 --> 02:20.173
Say, Master Loki, have you heard?

02:20.173 --> 02:21.341
About what?

02:21.341 --> 02:25.278
I was told there will be a wedding
at Mayura's temple on Sunday.

02:25.278 --> 02:27.380
There? Really?

02:27.380 --> 02:30.178
It appears the one getting married
is a friend of Mayura.

02:31.284 --> 02:33.411
People are into all kinds of
things, aren't they?

02:33.853 --> 02:36.321
Do they serve food at these "weddings"?

02:37.290 --> 02:40.460
Eating really is all you ever
think about, isn't it?

02:40.460 --> 02:42.257
Well, I am a...

02:49.802 --> 02:51.429
Good evening, Lord Loki.

02:51.871 --> 02:54.066
Verdandi? What do you want?

02:54.807 --> 02:59.279
As one who weaves the threads of fate,
I come to impart a prophecy.

02:59.279 --> 03:01.915
Oh? And what would that be?

03:01.915 --> 03:04.817
The day that the maiden in
white finds happiness,

03:04.817 --> 03:07.020
her banquet will be awash in sorrow...

03:07.020 --> 03:09.289
just as the life of the evil god ends.

03:09.289 --> 03:11.791
You're planning to involve
others in this now?

03:11.791 --> 03:13.816
I thought I was your only target.

03:14.561 --> 03:17.463
I have come to impart this
prophecy, nothing more.

03:17.463 --> 03:18.930
Farewell.

03:23.303 --> 03:25.405
What was that about just now?

03:25.405 --> 03:27.473
A maiden in white...

03:27.473 --> 03:29.498
would that be Verdandi?

03:30.743 --> 03:33.913
No. The Norns do not speak of themselves.

03:33.913 --> 03:35.782
A maiden in white...

03:35.782 --> 03:38.512
Happiness... Banquet...

03:45.225 --> 03:49.355
Loki! Did you come to give me a hand?

03:49.829 --> 03:54.266
Not really. But there is something
that's been on my mind.

03:57.837 --> 04:02.008
You're just in time. I'm in the middle of
decorating the grounds. Come check it out!

04:02.008 --> 04:04.043
Are you actually going to
use that tanuki too?

04:04.043 --> 04:05.378
Of course!

04:05.378 --> 04:07.005
C'mon! This way.

04:15.088 --> 04:16.256
What is this?

04:16.256 --> 04:17.624
Isn't it great?

04:17.624 --> 04:19.959
Here's the god of marriage
from Monster Island,

04:19.959 --> 04:23.162
and this is a bride's mask that was
found in the ruins of Derodenga.

04:23.162 --> 04:27.861
All these wedding items I've put together will
lend a mysterious blessing to their wedding!

04:31.504 --> 04:34.632
I don't get the sense that this
place is "blessed" at all!

04:35.808 --> 04:38.278
For crying out loud! Ever since Mayura
began hanging out with you,

04:38.278 --> 04:40.246
she's gotten weirder and weirder!

04:40.413 --> 04:42.938
I don't think that's really my fault.

04:43.149 --> 04:44.984
What's with you? You got a
problem or something?

04:44.984 --> 04:46.386
You're darn right I do!

04:46.386 --> 04:49.389
Who the heck would want to get married
in such a creepy place?!

04:49.389 --> 04:51.357
Wow! It's gorgeous!

04:52.525 --> 04:53.993
Ayana!

04:53.993 --> 04:56.162
I wanted to see the place as soon as
I could, so I just dropped by.

04:56.162 --> 04:57.764
Well, come have a look!

04:57.764 --> 05:00.562
I've been decorating my heart out for you.

05:01.234 --> 05:02.635
I'm so happy!

05:02.635 --> 05:05.405
I knew it would turn out great
if I left things up to you!

05:05.405 --> 05:06.973
I'm so glad!

05:06.973 --> 05:10.704
Say, look! This is a blessed staff found
in the runes of Piaporopin.

05:10.910 --> 05:13.179
Good grief! I just don't get this at all.

05:13.179 --> 05:15.615
Is that woman an acquaintance of yours?

05:15.615 --> 05:19.619
Yeah. She's my cousin, and
a real mystery nut.

05:19.619 --> 05:23.423
I hear that she and Daidoji used to
contribute to the same occult magazine.

05:23.423 --> 05:25.291
I see.

05:25.291 --> 05:27.225
It takes all kinds, I suppose.

05:27.493 --> 05:30.396
This is going to be the best wedding ever!

05:30.396 --> 05:33.566
I'm so glad you're happy with everything!

05:33.566 --> 05:37.024
I've always dreamed of being a bride.

05:37.303 --> 05:42.900
I'm so lucky to be able to have my wedding
in such a wonderful place.

05:43.042 --> 05:44.711
Don't do that, Ayana!

05:44.711 --> 05:47.908
You can't cry any tears of joy until
you're married on Sunday!

05:48.881 --> 05:50.178
Yes, you're right.

05:50.850 --> 05:53.410
Let's make sure it's a wonderful wedding!

05:54.220 --> 05:56.688
Thank you so much, Mayura!

06:18.211 --> 06:20.680
Is it all right to keep going
ahead with this?

06:20.680 --> 06:23.816
I mean, she already told Loki
her prophecy, right?

06:23.816 --> 06:27.220
Verdandi has been extremely thorough
in formulating her plan.

06:27.220 --> 06:28.588
Let's just leave things to her.

06:28.588 --> 06:32.225
The Earth spirals upward, and
the heavens spiral down.

06:32.225 --> 06:34.227
O, evil powers that swirl about on Earth,

06:34.227 --> 06:36.787
let the sound of this bell
guide you, and unite!

06:44.537 --> 06:45.561
Did it work?

06:47.173 --> 06:49.008
Now all it needs is the finishing touch.

06:49.008 --> 06:50.270
"Finishing touch"?

06:50.476 --> 06:53.546
The prayer of a maiden on her happiest day.

06:53.546 --> 06:55.673
It will be the end of Loki.

07:06.626 --> 07:09.254
You can wear anything and make it
look good, Master Loki!

07:10.229 --> 07:11.662
I don't know.

07:12.532 --> 07:14.864
You just wore your school uniform?

07:15.435 --> 07:17.603
For me, a school uniform is formal!

07:17.603 --> 07:19.230
Ah, there you are!

07:24.043 --> 07:25.378
What a great outfit, Loki!

07:25.378 --> 07:26.712
Do you think it looks good on me?

07:26.712 --> 07:28.839
Yup! You look like a 5-year-old
on his way to a shrine!

07:29.282 --> 07:31.250
I'm not five years old!

07:31.784 --> 07:33.319
Sorry, sorry!

07:33.319 --> 07:35.822
In any event, this certainly
is quite a turnout.

07:35.822 --> 07:39.292
I thought it would be best to have
as many people as we could.

07:39.292 --> 07:42.728
Is that why you invited all of us as well?

07:42.728 --> 07:44.964
Is Ayana ready with her preparations?

07:44.964 --> 07:48.923
Well, they can't seem to find her wedding
ring, so they're looking for it right now.

07:49.535 --> 07:52.171
Oh, well. I guess I'll have to help out too.

07:52.171 --> 07:54.469
I still have some things to finish up, so...

07:56.509 --> 07:58.477
Fenrir, keep an eye on the bride.

07:58.778 --> 08:00.473
Just leave it to me, Daddy.

08:10.122 --> 08:11.224
Yamino.

08:11.224 --> 08:12.191
Right.

08:23.903 --> 08:25.598
What should I do?

08:26.439 --> 08:29.237
No shady characters are going to get by me!

08:37.950 --> 08:40.248
Verdandi! Just what are you up to?!

08:59.939 --> 09:05.400
Excuse me. Mayura requested
that I bring you this ring.

09:06.245 --> 09:08.941
She found it! Oh, thank you!

09:09.882 --> 09:12.009
Now I'll be able to make
the ceremony in time.

09:19.825 --> 09:22.161
What do you suppose it means?

09:22.161 --> 09:26.699
I don't know, but I'm certain she's planned
something for this wedding.

09:26.699 --> 09:27.996
Loki!

09:31.704 --> 09:33.194
Freya?!

09:33.739 --> 09:37.376
As long as I'm around, I won't have
you getting married to anyone!

09:37.376 --> 09:39.606
Uh, I'm not the one getting married here.

09:40.012 --> 09:42.148
I'm the only one who's right for you.

09:42.148 --> 09:44.082
Come on. Let's get married right now!

09:44.383 --> 09:46.476
Wait! Would you listen to me?!

09:50.089 --> 09:52.091
My Japanese beauty!

09:52.091 --> 09:55.788
I won't have you marrying anyone but me!

09:56.128 --> 09:58.397
Big brother! What are you doing here?

09:58.397 --> 10:01.100
Well, if it isn't Freya!

10:01.100 --> 10:06.800
I'm extremely busy trying to stop my Japanese
beauty from marrying the wrong guy!

10:07.106 --> 10:10.343
I keep telling you, it's someone else
who's getting married!

10:10.343 --> 10:11.844
Listen to me, damn it!

10:11.844 --> 10:14.013
It's not hard to believe they're
brother and sister, is it?

10:14.013 --> 10:15.378
They really are a lot alike.

10:15.748 --> 10:17.375
Don't get in the way, Frey!

10:18.284 --> 10:21.621
That outfit! Don't tell me you're
getting married too!

10:21.621 --> 10:23.456
You mustn't! You're still too young!

10:23.456 --> 10:26.125
Loki and I have shared our love
for quite some time!

10:26.125 --> 10:30.084
You need to get a grip and think this through!
Love is nothing but a passing fever!

10:30.563 --> 10:32.565
You ought to listen to your own advice!

10:32.565 --> 10:34.100
There's no point in arguing!

10:34.100 --> 10:37.467
Gullinbursti! Stop Freya from this
frenzy of love she's caught up in!

10:49.215 --> 10:51.317
What did they even come here for?

10:51.317 --> 10:53.152
Master Loki! We have more important business.

10:53.152 --> 10:54.119
Right!

10:55.688 --> 10:57.790
Loki! We've got a problem!

10:57.790 --> 10:59.659
Ayana's disappeared!

10:59.659 --> 11:00.693
What did you say?!

11:00.693 --> 11:03.992
I'm sorry, Daddy. I took my eye off
her for a second, and...

11:04.430 --> 11:05.795
Verdandi.

11:06.866 --> 11:09.368
You guys search this area.

11:09.368 --> 11:11.700
I'm going to check out the place
she was last seen.

11:12.038 --> 11:13.335
All right.

11:14.807 --> 11:17.401
Mayura, you go ahead and continue
with your preparations.

11:18.310 --> 11:19.979
But what about Ayana?

11:19.979 --> 11:21.247
Don't worry.

11:21.247 --> 11:23.082
We'll find her, no matter what.

11:23.082 --> 11:24.549
All right.

11:49.141 --> 11:51.109
Ayana! Are you all right?

11:55.114 --> 11:57.082
I'm fine...

11:57.850 --> 11:58.874
Lord Loki.

12:08.594 --> 12:10.357
Everything is going as planned.

12:10.429 --> 12:10.663
Bride's
Waiting
Room

12:10.663 --> 12:13.097
Bride's
Waiting
Room
We can't find her, Master Loki.

12:14.200 --> 12:16.225
Huh? Master Loki?

12:16.635 --> 12:20.503
That's strange. I wonder if
I just missed him.

12:28.247 --> 12:29.942
You caught me off-guard.

12:30.282 --> 12:33.410
What do you think of my resort island?

12:33.719 --> 12:35.550
A resort, huh?

12:36.021 --> 12:38.524
I'd have to say it's rather bleak.

12:38.524 --> 12:41.584
If swimming in the ocean is more to your
liking, feel free to enjoy yourself.

12:42.394 --> 12:45.331
Unfortunately, I doubt I'll be in
much of a swimming mood.

12:45.331 --> 12:49.199
Oh, you'll have to excuse me!
I'd forgotten how you hate the water.

12:51.003 --> 12:52.872
Where is Ayana?

12:52.872 --> 12:56.933
Have no fear. She is in a safe place.

13:04.517 --> 13:07.714
Why did you have to involve her?
She's got nothing to do with this!

13:07.787 --> 13:10.790
My actions are not without meaning.

13:10.790 --> 13:12.758
All are part of my calculations.

13:12.958 --> 13:14.721
We'll see about that.

13:27.339 --> 13:30.042
This barrier has been created
from a bride's emotions,

13:30.042 --> 13:34.502
which are at their peak as her
wedding approaches.

13:38.951 --> 13:41.353
All girls dream of their wedding!

13:41.353 --> 13:47.053
The rush of emotions and excitement will
give me the power to defeat you, Lord Loki.

13:47.393 --> 13:49.361
That's why you've done this to Ayana?

13:55.768 --> 14:00.467
Beings that flow in the clear and
deep abyss, come forth!

14:00.639 --> 14:03.699
O multitude of droplets, become one
and generate immense power!

14:18.157 --> 14:21.160
Oh, Yamino! Any word on Ayana?

14:21.160 --> 14:22.628
Nothing yet.

14:22.628 --> 14:25.564
Did you happen to see Master Loki?

14:25.564 --> 14:28.133
Has Loki vanished too?

14:28.133 --> 14:31.070
Yes. I can't find him anywhere.

14:31.070 --> 14:33.868
What are we going to do?
The ceremony's about to start.

14:34.206 --> 14:37.209
For now, we'll just search as best as we can.

14:37.209 --> 14:40.246
In the meantime, please try to buy us
as much time as possible.

14:40.246 --> 14:42.147
Huh? But how?

14:42.147 --> 14:43.774
We're counting on you!

14:45.417 --> 14:46.318
What do I do now?

14:46.318 --> 14:46.752
Howdy! Mikawaya here!
What do I do now?

14:46.752 --> 14:49.050
Howdy! Mikawaya here!

14:50.256 --> 14:51.723
Ah! There you are!

15:14.046 --> 15:16.448
I wonder how long you'll be
able to evade those.

15:16.448 --> 15:19.051
You know, you can escape into the
water whenever you like.

15:19.051 --> 15:20.185
Whoa!

15:20.185 --> 15:22.153
I wouldn't want you to
hold back on my account.

15:22.421 --> 15:24.389
In that case, I won't.

15:41.373 --> 15:43.375
I'm not surprised to see
that you're powerless

15:43.375 --> 15:45.843
against an opponent made of your
greatest weakness: Water!

15:53.419 --> 15:55.955
What could have happened to Master Loki?

15:55.955 --> 15:57.855
Don't tell me that Verdandi got to him!

15:58.190 --> 16:00.492
Let's not start worrying until we've
actually looked for him!

16:00.492 --> 16:02.119
Daddy must be around...

16:02.928 --> 16:04.555
What's the matter?

16:05.564 --> 16:07.361
Shh! Keep quiet.

16:25.217 --> 16:26.952
That's Verdandi's bell!

16:26.952 --> 16:29.221
I don't hear anything...

16:29.221 --> 16:32.315
It's the same one from before.
There's no mistake!

16:32.958 --> 16:34.793
Can you really hear it?

16:34.793 --> 16:36.158
This way. Follow me!

16:36.962 --> 16:38.930
Big brother! Wait!

16:49.541 --> 16:50.976
Are you all right?

16:50.976 --> 16:52.102
Just leave it to me!

17:04.289 --> 17:06.951
This stuff rocks! Gimme anoth...

17:08.227 --> 17:09.895
Hey, are you all right?

17:09.895 --> 17:12.022
We'll just go and fix her makeup real quick.

17:20.773 --> 17:23.367
I can't believe you're this bad
at holding your liquor!

17:23.542 --> 17:26.443
Ayana! Hurry up and get back here!

17:39.291 --> 17:40.986
There's no end to them.

17:46.532 --> 17:49.501
It looks like you're out of places to run to.

17:49.935 --> 17:52.165
Prepare to meet your doom, Lord Loki!

17:57.543 --> 17:59.511
It's no use going after the bell.

18:00.245 --> 18:03.082
My magical powers are enhanced by
the emotions of a young bride,

18:03.082 --> 18:05.050
and now surely exceed your own!

18:42.421 --> 18:43.755
In here.

18:43.755 --> 18:46.358
It just looks like an ordinary tree.

18:46.358 --> 18:48.326
Then have a look at this!

18:58.103 --> 18:59.505
Ayana!

18:59.505 --> 19:02.007
She'd been magically sealed in there.

19:02.007 --> 19:04.237
Ayana? Where is Master Loki?

19:09.548 --> 19:11.550
Get that ring off her finger quick!

19:11.550 --> 19:12.676
Oh, right.

19:22.761 --> 19:24.388
What's going on?!

19:27.799 --> 19:29.960
It looks like your calculations
have gone awry.

19:30.302 --> 19:33.038
My calculations are perfect!

19:33.038 --> 19:36.565
Something like this can't happen!
It's just not possible!

19:36.875 --> 19:39.912
There are some things that can't be calculated.

19:39.912 --> 19:42.403
In the human world, they're called "miracles."

19:42.748 --> 19:45.584
I... I'm not beaten just yet!

19:45.584 --> 19:47.176
Get him, my water dragon!

20:10.242 --> 20:11.732
Vere luvadrok!

20:12.978 --> 20:14.445
Cuerios!

20:26.858 --> 20:29.053
Nice try, Verdandi.

20:33.332 --> 20:35.267
Daddy! You're all right!

20:35.267 --> 20:36.564
Ah, Fenrir.

20:37.002 --> 20:39.004
We found Ayana.

20:39.004 --> 20:41.740
Thanks, Fenrir. You've been a big help.

20:41.740 --> 20:44.843
But how? You should never have
been able to find that place!

20:44.843 --> 20:46.868
I could hear the sound of your bell!

20:47.279 --> 20:48.303
Impossible!

20:48.747 --> 20:50.942
You underestimated Fenrir's ears, didn't you?

20:54.086 --> 20:55.553
Just a moment!

20:56.955 --> 20:59.458
Give Ayana's ring back.

20:59.458 --> 21:02.086
They need it for the wedding ceremony.

21:06.265 --> 21:07.823
Thank you.

21:30.222 --> 21:33.592
Thank goodness it worked out.
Ayana looks so happy!

21:33.592 --> 21:34.752
She sure does.

21:39.631 --> 21:43.590
Someday, I want to have a wonderful
wedding like this too!

21:44.036 --> 21:46.334
I've already had enough of this wedding.

21:57.316 --> 22:01.047
Next time... Next time for sure!

22:16.935 --> 22:28.904
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.582 --> 22:42.327
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.327 --> 22:49.534
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.534 --> 22:55.874
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:55.874 --> 23:05.384
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.384 --> 23:09.721
Kizutsuitemo

23:09.721 --> 23:21.733
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:21.733 --> 23:23.462
Believe in Heaven

23:31.309 --> 23:32.177
Next Episode

23:32.177 --> 23:34.379
Next Episode
The key words for the next episode
are "cuisine," "specter"

23:34.379 --> 23:35.914
Next Episode
and "giant, peach-colored,
polka-dotted squid."

23:35.914 --> 23:38.083
Next Episode
Say, Mr. Thief, do you know how to cook?

23:38.083 --> 23:40.585
Next Episode
I may not look it, but I happen
to be a big-time gourmand.

23:40.585 --> 23:42.521
Next Episode
Really? So what kind of things do you cook?

23:42.521 --> 23:43.922
Next Episode
Well for example, there's boiled
and seasoned pumpkin...

23:43.922 --> 23:44.956
Next Episode
Hey, Higashiyama, do you know how to cook?
Well for example, there's boiled
and seasoned pumpkin...

23:44.956 --> 23:46.324
Next Episode
Hey, Higashiyama, do you know how to cook?

23:46.324 --> 23:47.526
Next Episode
I don't cook.

23:47.526 --> 23:49.060
Next Episode
No? But it's so interesting.

23:49.060 --> 23:50.595
Next Episode
I don't like getting my hands dirty.

23:50.595 --> 23:53.965
Next Episode
Hey, my Japanese beauty! Why don't you
listen when people are talking?

23:53.965 --> 23:55.000
Next Episode
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.000 --> 23:55.300
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.300 --> 23:55.667
"Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary"

23:55.667 --> 23:57.469
The 17th Night
Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary!
"Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary"

23:57.469 --> 23:59.171
The 17th Night
Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary!
Another strange mystery!

23:59.171 --> 24:00.505
The 17th Night
Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary!
Ignoring me, huh?!

24:00.505 --> 24:01.130
The 17th Night
Crashing into the Kitchen Sanctuary!
